{"reference":"2 Samuel 21","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":21,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Book’s Larger Shape","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel moves from David’s accession and kingdom consolidation through the ark and dynasty promise, then through royal abuse, household violence, rebellion, and grief, before closing with a four-part appendix. This broader shape places the chapter within the book’s concluding material rather than within the earlier continuous account of David’s rise and reign.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 1","2 Samuel 10:1-19","2 Samuel 11:1-27","2 Samuel 12:1-31","2 Samuel 13:1-39","2 Samuel 14:1-33","2 Samuel 15:1-37","2 Samuel 16:1-23","2 Samuel 17:1-29","2 Samuel 18:1-33","2 Samuel 19:1-43","2 Samuel 20:1-26","2 Samuel 22:1-51","2 Samuel 23:1-39","2 Samuel 24:1-25","2 Samuel 2:1-32","2 Samuel 3:1-39","2 Samuel 4:1-12","2 Samuel 5:1-25","2 Samuel 6:1-23","2 Samuel 7:1-29","2 Samuel 8:1-18","2 Samuel 9:1-13"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_021_d54366264197f8311dab5afe"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}